font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nThe <b>Fire Dragon Dojo</b> is a training area for <a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Chosen\">Lizard Chosens</a>, located under the <a href=\"#/wiki/Temple%20of%20Equilibrium\">Temple of Equilibrium</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33181,31202,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33181, 31202, 7)</a>). It consists of 5 separate segments each containing between 5 and 15 Lizard Chosens, the number increasing the deeper you advance. The Gray Shadow clan, a league of assassins headed by <a href=\"#/wiki/Nina\">Nina</a>, can be seen hiding in the walls, observing the training lizards. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Chosen\"><img alt=\"Lizard Chosen\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lizard_Chosen_f2f444.gif\" width=\"55\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Chosen\">Lizard Chosen</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">2,530</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">3,050</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">880</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-236× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></li>\n<li>0-5× <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a></li>\n<li>Cursed Shoulder Spikes</li>\n<li>0-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Health%20Potion\">Great Health Potion</a></li>\n<li>Spiked Iron Ball</li>\n<li>Corrupted Flag (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Leather\">Lizard Leather</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Scale%20of%20Corruption\">Scale of Corruption</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>0-5× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Diamond\">Small Diamond</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Scale\">Lizard Scale</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Tower%20Shield\">Tower Shield</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Zaoan%20Armor\">Zaoan Armor</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Zaoan%20Legs\">Zaoan Legs</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Zaoan%20Shoes\">Zaoan Shoes</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Collar%20of%20Orange%20Plasma\">Collar of Orange Plasma</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Zaoan%20Helmet\">Zaoan Helmet</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"32pxd\"><img alt=\"32pxd\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Parchment_77aa91.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span><figcaption>32pxd</figcaption></figure><p><i>This  article is a stub. You can help TibiaWiki by expanding it.</i></p></div></div>","quests":[]}